
Manual mode: what to set up (type numbers to toggle, Enter when done)
  1  [x] lea        runs the agents; they reach the locks
  2  [x] locksql    databases: PostgreSQL, MySQL, MariaDB, SQLite
  3  [x] lockmq     RabbitMQ: queues and streams
  4  [ ] lockfile   files: a local directory, S3, SFTP
  5  [ ] lockhttp   the web requests of lea's agents, held at lea's gate
  6  [-] locklog    lox init does not set it up yet: lox add locklog INSTANCE
  declared in lockfamily.yaml (uncheck to remove; its profile stays in the lock's directory):
  7  [x] web        lockhttp, profile default
